<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92525" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥιπτ-άζω</span></b> , Frequentat. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥίπτω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>throw
				to and fro, toss about</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥιπτάζων κατὰ δῶμα θεούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					14.257
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀφρύσι ῥιπτάζεσκε</span>
			<i>moved</i> the eyebrows <i>up and down,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Merc.
				279
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>toss about</i>, esp. in bed, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				4.31
			</span></i> (so 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥιπτάζειν ἑαυτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Morb.</u>
					2.69
				</span></i>
			; and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥιπτάζειν</span> alone,
				<i>Acut. (Sp.</i>)<i><span class="en">
				18
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρᾶγμα πολλαῖσι . . ἀγρυπνίαισιν
					ἐρριπτασμένον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕφη γυναικῶν . . ἐρριπτάζετο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					210 iii 12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ γνώμῃ πολλὰ ῥιπτασθεὶς ἐπ᾽
					ἀμφότερα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cic.</u>
					37
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥιπτάσαι περιδεῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BCH</u>
					48.518
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Palestine</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			 also,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥίπτομαι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.164
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>).</div>
